  neither                   no angular channel at all; nine pair-graph convolutions (manuscript Table 3, arm B)
  line graph                angles as ALIGNN input features, no angular objective (manuscript Table 3, arm A; = A0)
  angle state               the bond-angle field as an independently diffused state with no line graph: the persistent triplet set is embedded, supervised with a score-matching loss, and coupled to coordinates through the shared trunk only (= B3 at alignn_layers=0)
  line graph + angle state  the proposed model: state is (F, L, Theta), independently corrupted, persistent triplets, smooth relevance gates, one joint denoiser, coupled through angles -> bonds -> atoms (= B3)

